    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Room COUNT = ceil(speakers ÷ 8), at least 1 — 13 speakers → 2 rooms. <b>Nobody is placed automatically.</b> The Allocator hook only reports drops (<code>place {id, slot}</code> / <code>unplace {id}</code>); the server keeps the draft (<code>draft_allocation</code>) and re-renders — every open owner tab sees the same draft. <b>Start session</b> closes registration and turns the draft into engine rooms."
